---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ArticleSchema from "../../components/schema/ArticleSchema.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";

const tableOfContents = [
  { id: "intro", label: "Opening" },
  { id: "fractional-ciso", label: "Fractional CISO role" },
  { id: "probo-does", label: "What Probo does" },
  { id: "complements", label: "Complements, not substitutes" },
  { id: "sequencing", label: "Sequencing" },
  { id: "tco", label: "Year-one TCO" },
  { id: "when-ciso", label: "When a CISO first" },
  { id: "recommendation", label: "Recommendation" },
];
---

<Layout
  title={"Probo vs Hiring a Fractional CISO"}
  description={"Fractional CISO vs Probo is not tool vs tool: it is leadership vs compliance execution. Role boundaries, sequencing, year-one TCO, and when to hire each."}
>
  <ArticleSchema
    title="Probo vs Hiring a Fractional CISO"
    description="Compare fractional CISO leadership with Probo's compliance execution: scope, sequencing, year-one TCO, and when to add each."
    url="https://www.probo.com/hub/probo-vs-fractional-ciso"
    image="https://www.probo.com/probo-logo.svg"
    datePublished="2026-04-23"
    dateModified="2026-08-31"
  />
  <main class="container my-10 sm:my-20">
    <Breadcrumbs
      items={[
        { label: "Hub", href: "/hub" },
        { label: "Probo vs Hiring a Fractional CISO" },
      ]}
      class="mb-6"
    />
    <header class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[900px] text-center sm:mb-16">
      <h1
        class="text-foreground mb-6 text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.12] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[3rem]"
      >
        {"Probo vs Hiring a"}
        {" "}
        <span class="highlight-text">{"Fractional CISO"}</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-muted-foreground mx-auto max-w-[720px] text-lg leading-relaxed"
      >
        {
          "A budget line versus an outcome: how to sequence security leadership and compliance execution without paying twice for the same work."
        }
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16">
      <aside class="shrink-0 lg:w-56">
        <nav class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {
              tableOfContents.map((item) => (
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-section={item.id}
                  class="toc-link cursor-pointer border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-left text-sm leading-5 text-[#6b716a] transition-colors hover:text-[#141e12]"
                >
                  {item.label}
                </button>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <article class="max-w-[720px] flex-1">
        <section id="intro" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {
                'Your board meeting ran long. Your lead investor pulled you aside afterward: "You need a security leader. Enterprise deals are going to stall without one. I know a great fractional CISO - $8k a month, starts next Monday."'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "You do the math on the walk back. $96k a year. Then you think about the SOC 2 platform you were going to buy for $15k. Then the auditor. Then the hours your engineers are going to burn on evidence. You're looking at $150k and ~200 engineering hours to get to a Type II report and an enterprise-ready posture."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "You haven't hired anyone yet and you're already out six figures."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {"This article isn't a comparison between two compliance tools. "}
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  "It's a comparison between a budget line and an outcome."
                }</strong
              >
              {" Here's how to think about it."}
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="fractional-ciso" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"What a Fractional CISO Actually Does"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {
                "Before comparing, let's be precise about what you're buying when you hire a fractional CISO (vCISO, part-time CSO - same role, different labels)."
              }
            </p>
            <p>{"A fractional CISO typically provides:"}</p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Strategic security leadership"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - 1-on-1 with CEO, board-facing reporting, executive security narrative"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground">{"Program design"}</strong>{
                    " - roadmap, framework selection, risk management strategy"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Vendor and tool selection"}</strong
                  >{
                    ' - "you should use Vanta/Drata/Secureframe, here\'s why"'
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Policy review and approval"}</strong
                  >{" - not usually writing, but reviewing"}</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Incident response leadership"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - on-call for real incidents, tabletop facilitation"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Enterprise buyer-facing presence"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - attends security reviews, speaks to prospects' security teams"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{
                      "Recruiting your eventual full-time security hire"
                    }</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"What a fractional CISO typically doesn't do:"}</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Write your SOC 2 policies in full detail"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Upload evidence to your compliance platform"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{
                    "Coordinate with your auditor on scheduling, walkthroughs, and evidence Q&A"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Answer vendor security questionnaires"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Remediate failed controls hands-on"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Run your Trust Center"}</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              {"Their value is "}
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"leadership, strategy, and presence."}</strong
              >
              {
                " Execution is not their job - and at $8k/month for 10-20 hours, there isn't capacity for it anyway."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="probo-does" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"What Probo Actually Does"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {"Probo is not a leadership role. "}
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"Probo is a compliance execution team."}</strong
              >
              {" What we cover:"}
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Framework scoping and mapping"}</strong
                  >{" - "}
                  <a href="/hub/soc2" class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                    >{"SOC 2"}</a
                  >{", "}
                  <a href="/hub/iso27001" class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                    >{"ISO 27001"}</a
                  >{", HIPAA, GDPR, NIS2, etc."}</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground">{"Policy drafting"}</strong>{
                    " - custom to your stack, ~12-18 policies written for you"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Evidence collection"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - integrations + our team chasing what integrations miss"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Auditor selection, coordination, and management"}</strong
                  >{" - we run the audit"}</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground">{"Remediation"}</strong>{
                    " - failed controls get proposed fixes; we implement where possible"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Questionnaire response"}</strong
                  >{" - 24-48 hour turnaround"}</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Trust Center hosting"}</strong
                  >{" - compliance reports, sub-processor list, DPA"}</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground">{"Framework renewal"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - Type II, ISO surveillance, HIPAA risk analysis updates"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"What Probo doesn't do:"}</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Be your board-facing security executive"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{
                    "Lead live incident response (we coordinate, but you or your team owns the technical response)"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{'Pitch prospects as "our CISO"'}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{"Own the long-term security roadmap for your company"}</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="complements" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"These Aren't Substitutes. They're Complements."}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {"Here's where most founders miscategorize the decision. "}
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  "A fractional CISO and Probo solve different problems."
                }</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{"A fractional CISO solves "}
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"leadership and narrative."}</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{"Probo solves "}
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"compliance execution."}</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              {
                "If you hire only a fractional CISO, you still need someone to do the work: an internal compliance owner, a security engineer, or a platform plus internal hours. The CISO's strategy is only as valuable as your execution. If the gap is execution, compare "
              }
              <a
                href="/hub/top-compliance-officer-services-2026"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                >{"compliance officer services"}</a
              >
              {" and "}
              <a
                href="/blog/2025-10-17-what-is-hands-off-compliance"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                >{"hands-off compliance"}</a
              >
              {"."}
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                'If you use only Probo, you still need someone to be the face of security to the board and to large enterprise buyers who want to talk to "your CISO." Most Probo customers under 60 people fill that role with the founder or head of engineering, supported by our artifacts. Above 60-80 people, a part-time or full-time security leader usually enters the picture.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  'The right question isn\'t "Probo vs fractional CISO."'
                }</strong
              >
              {" It's: "}
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  '"Which one do I need first, and when do I add the other?"'
                }</strong
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="sequencing" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"The Sequencing Most Founders Get Wrong"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {
                "The mistake: hiring a fractional CISO first, before you have a compliance program."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "Here's what happens. Month 1: CISO does an assessment. Month 2: CISO recommends a platform. Month 3: You buy the platform. Months 3-8: The CISO guides, the platform tracks, and "
              }
              <em>{"you and your engineers do the work"}</em>
              {
                ". You're paying $8k/month for guidance on a program you're executing yourself."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  "The correct sequencing for most startups under 60 people:"
                }</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ol class="ml-0 list-none space-y-4">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">1.</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground">{"Probo first"}</strong>{
                    " - get "
                  }
                  <a
                    href="/hub/soc2-type1-vs-type2"
                    class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline">{"SOC 2 Type I"}</a
                  >
                  {
                    " in 8-12 weeks, Type II at month 12. Your compliance posture is handled."
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">2.</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Fractional CISO second (if needed)"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - add at year 2 when enterprise buyers start asking \"who's your CISO?\" or when you need board-level security narrative. By now, compliance execution is stable, so the CISO's hours go to strategy, not setup."
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">3.</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Full-time CISO eventually"}</strong
                  >{
                    " - usually at 80-150 people, when security becomes a core function."
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"The exception:"}</strong>
              {
                " if you're in a high-regulation vertical (defense, fintech, health systems) and you need a CISO presence in sales cycles from day one, hire the CISO first and use Probo underneath them for execution. They'll thank you for it."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="tco" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"The TCO Comparison, Year One"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {"Simplified for a 30-person SaaS targeting SOC 2 Type II:"}
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"Option A: Fractional CISO + self-driven compliance"}</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Fractional CISO: $96k/year"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Compliance platform: $12k/year"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"External auditor: $18k"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{
                    "Founder + engineering hours: ~180 hours (worth ~$25k in opportunity cost)"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Total: ~$151k cash + $25k opportunity = $176k"}</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Option B: Probo alone"}</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{
                    "Probo managed service (including auditor): ~$35k-45k"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Founder + engineering hours: ~20 hours"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Total: ~$40k cash + $3k opportunity = $43k"}</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"Option C: Probo + fractional CISO (later)"}</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>{"Probo (year 1): ~$40k"}</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  >{
                    "Fractional CISO added at month 14: ~$96k/year starting year 2"
                  }</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span
                  ><strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Total year 1: ~$40k. Year 2: ~$136k."}</strong
                  ></span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              {
                "The delta between Option A and B is ~$130k in year one, at the cost of the CISO's leadership narrative - which most early-stage companies don't actually need in front of buyers yet."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="when-ciso" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"When a Fractional CISO Is Worth It Anyway"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {"Three scenarios where hiring a CISO first makes sense:"}
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  "1. You're selling to regulated enterprise buyers in year one."
                }</strong
              >
              {
                " Defense, critical infrastructure, top-tier financial services. Their vendor review teams want to speak to your CISO by name. No amount of compliance posture substitutes for the title."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"2. You're raising a growth round soon."}</strong
              >
              {
                ' Series B and later rounds increasingly ask "who\'s your security leader?" as a diligence question. A fractional CISO can be a credible answer.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"3. You've had a security incident."}</strong
              >
              {
                " Board-level narrative matters more than compliance paperwork in this case. Get the CISO in fast."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <blockquote
          class="border-border-low my-10 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#5d770d] bg-[#f8f9f7] p-6 not-italic"
        >
          <p class="text-foreground mb-3 font-semibold">
            {
              "Deciding between hiring a fractional CISO and ramping compliance?"
            }
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            {
              "Let's scope your stage, your buyers, and your timeline. 30 minutes, no slides."
            }
          </p>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
          >
            {"Book a Call"}
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="16"
              height="16"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg
            >
          </a>
        </blockquote>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="recommendation" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"The Honest Recommendation"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"Under 40 people, pre-enterprise:"}</strong
              >
              {
                " Probo alone. Execution is the bottleneck, not strategy. Add a CISO later."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"40-80 people, early enterprise pipeline:"}</strong
              >
              {
